WEBVTT

01:49.490 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:57.940
[Episode 37]

02:04.870 --> 02:06.000
Wait for me outside.

02:06.020 --> 02:07.260
Yes, Your Highness.

02:08.960 --> 02:09.880
Xiaoyu, you're here.

02:09.880 --> 02:10.710
Come, come, come,

02:10.710 --> 02:11.720
have a seat.

02:11.800 --> 02:12.960
His Majesty was poisoned,

02:12.960 --> 02:14.220
and Nan Rui was framed—

02:14.470 --> 02:16.710
these were all your doing, weren't they?

02:16.710 --> 02:18.770
You actually harmed innocent people

02:18.910 --> 02:21.440
just to make the iconic scenes
happen sooner.

02:24.700 --> 02:26.540
If a man wants to fill his belly,

02:26.570 --> 02:28.470
he must plant crops in the fields.

02:28.910 --> 02:30.600
As spring turns to autumn,

02:31.310 --> 02:33.079
seeds grow into fruit

02:33.120 --> 02:34.520
and are eventually harvested.

02:34.520 --> 02:36.050
This is the way of the world.

02:36.710 --> 02:38.120
Just like this sweet potato—

02:38.120 --> 02:39.530
do you feel cruel

02:39.710 --> 02:40.960
when you eat it?

02:42.280 --> 02:43.880
So, in your eyes, human lives

02:44.310 --> 02:46.110
are no more than sweet potatoes?

02:46.310 --> 02:47.690
You really are absurd.

02:47.800 --> 02:48.590
They're just a bunch of

02:48.590 --> 02:50.910
fictional characters I created myself.

02:51.430 --> 02:52.630
How much more precious

02:52.630 --> 02:54.079
can their lives be
than this sweet potato...

02:54.079 --> 02:55.800
Even if they're just fictional characters,

02:55.800 --> 02:57.650
you created them yourself.

02:57.750 --> 02:59.190
Didn't you invest your emotions

02:59.190 --> 03:00.560
and effort?

03:02.710 --> 03:04.030
On a screen,

03:04.360 --> 03:05.590
they're nothing more than

03:05.590 --> 03:08.320
lines of code—easily edited
and deleted at will.

03:09.240 --> 03:10.660
Today I kill one emperor,

03:11.000 --> 03:12.520
and tomorrow I can write 100,

03:12.520 --> 03:13.310
1,000,

03:13.310 --> 03:14.240
or 10,000.

03:15.150 --> 03:16.210
Song Xiaoyu,

03:16.590 --> 03:19.190
you're the one who's
never been clear-headed.

03:19.400 --> 03:20.840
How are the people in this world

03:20.840 --> 03:21.680
any different from the Barbie dolls

03:21.680 --> 03:23.430
you grew tired of as a child?

03:23.710 --> 03:24.710
They're all fake.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.120
I really misjudged you.

03:31.810 --> 03:33.530
In the real world,

03:33.630 --> 03:35.240
you're a crap screenwriter who doesn't

03:35.240 --> 03:36.750
cherish the characters you create.

03:36.750 --> 03:37.820
And here,

03:37.910 --> 03:39.910
you're just a lunatic who kills
innocent people!

03:39.910 --> 03:40.750
So what?

03:41.750 --> 03:42.680
I have the power to kill

03:42.680 --> 03:44.000
and the power to save.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.890
Do you want to know

03:48.520 --> 03:50.000
how Nan Heng got sick?

03:52.520 --> 03:53.360
Wasn't it...

03:54.800 --> 03:56.280
you who poisoned him?

03:56.400 --> 03:57.520
Me? Poison him?

03:58.820 --> 04:00.360
I wouldn't bother

04:00.360 --> 04:01.690
with such dirty tricks.

04:02.410 --> 04:03.600
Do you really think

04:04.030 --> 04:05.030
those three rules I told you

04:05.030 --> 04:07.310
are the only ones in this scripted world?

04:09.930 --> 04:10.960
Let me tell you,

04:10.980 --> 04:12.010
in this scripted world,

04:12.010 --> 04:13.010
there are four...

04:15.030 --> 04:16.720
there are three rules.

04:16.839 --> 04:18.399
There are other rules?

04:20.160 --> 04:22.360
They're related to Nan Heng's illness?

04:23.600 --> 04:25.240
Didn't he tell you the truth?

04:25.950 --> 04:26.630
Fine.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.270
Then I'll tell you.

04:28.510 --> 04:30.410
The fourth rule is

04:30.920 --> 04:32.360
that those who change the iconic scenes

04:32.360 --> 04:33.760
will suffer backlash.

04:37.980 --> 04:39.070
Nan Heng...

04:41.310 --> 04:42.680
What will happen to him?

04:43.600 --> 04:46.390
If the plot continues to deviate
from its original course,

04:46.390 --> 04:48.360
he'll only grow weaker and weaker

04:48.720 --> 04:49.750
until he dies.

04:51.950 --> 04:52.750
Song Xiaoyu,

04:53.350 --> 04:54.510
don't you love him

04:54.600 --> 04:56.280
and this scripted world?

04:56.430 --> 04:57.420
So, tell me,

04:57.480 --> 04:58.800
are you going to go against
the plots I wrote

04:58.800 --> 05:00.070
and watch Nan Heng die,

05:00.360 --> 05:02.310
or help me complete all the iconic scenes

05:02.310 --> 05:04.000
and return to the real world together?

05:04.000 --> 05:05.530
That way, he can still live.

05:12.310 --> 05:13.170
Offer incense?

05:13.920 --> 05:14.800
Today's the first day of the month,

05:14.800 --> 05:15.830
an auspicious day.

05:15.830 --> 05:18.040
To pray for a happy marriage
for Miss Yiting,

05:18.040 --> 05:19.360
Madam got up early and took her

05:19.360 --> 05:21.560
to the Temple of the God of Matchmaking.

05:22.430 --> 05:24.490
The Temple of the God of Matchmaking?

05:26.210 --> 05:30.270
[Song Residence]

05:30.600 --> 05:33.990
[Outskirts; Temple of
the God of Matchmaking]

05:34.190 --> 05:35.159
Hurry up.

05:35.159 --> 05:35.830
See?

05:35.830 --> 05:37.490
There are so many people here.

05:37.750 --> 05:38.560
So great.

05:38.580 --> 05:39.850
Come on, come on.

05:40.800 --> 05:41.830
Mom, I told you,

05:41.830 --> 05:42.820
if you want to pray, do it yourself.

05:42.820 --> 05:44.480
I don't believe in this stuff.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.600
A happy marriage depends on

05:47.600 --> 05:49.680
how you get along and work things out.

05:49.680 --> 05:50.950
I can't even clearly say

05:50.950 --> 05:52.390
what my future with him will be like,

05:52.390 --> 05:53.390
so why put all our hope

05:53.390 --> 05:55.780
in something so intangible?

05:57.270 --> 05:58.620
Watch your words.

05:58.720 --> 05:59.690
The God of Matchmaking is watching above.

05:59.690 --> 06:00.810
Show some respect.

06:01.070 --> 06:01.950
Seriously.

06:03.040 --> 06:04.300
God of Matchmaking,

06:04.430 --> 06:06.490
this devotee has only this daughter.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.180
I vow three years of my life

06:08.270 --> 06:10.720
in exchange for my daughter's
lifelong peace

06:10.720 --> 06:12.000
and a happy marriage.

06:12.600 --> 06:14.120
God of Matchmaking, please bless her.

06:14.120 --> 06:16.250
God of Matchmaking, please bless her.

06:17.040 --> 06:17.880
Hurry.

06:17.950 --> 06:18.750
What are you doing?

06:18.750 --> 06:19.560
Why are you standing there like a statue?

06:19.560 --> 06:21.130
Hurry up and make a wish.

06:21.310 --> 06:22.510
Quick, quick, quick.

06:24.800 --> 06:27.420
Please bless my daughter,
God of Matchmaking.

06:27.830 --> 06:30.530
God of Matchmaking, please bless
my daughter's marriage.

06:30.530 --> 06:32.460
God of Matchmaking, please bless
my daughter

06:32.460 --> 06:33.409
with a happy marriage.

06:33.409 --> 06:34.050
Mom.

06:34.120 --> 06:34.800
Please bless her.

06:34.800 --> 06:36.360
Just a few days ago,

06:36.360 --> 06:37.720
you were criticizing Shangguan He
like crazy.

06:37.720 --> 06:40.540
You said his eyes were too flirtatious,

06:40.870 --> 06:42.240
destined to take concubines in the future.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.120
You also said

06:43.270 --> 06:44.720
that his philtrum was a bit too short,

06:44.720 --> 06:46.920
which meant he'd bring
misfortune to his wife.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.920
You even said that I chose my own husband,

06:48.920 --> 06:50.070
and that if I ever regretted it,

06:50.070 --> 06:51.430
you'd let me cry myself to death
without caring.

06:51.430 --> 06:52.240
What?

06:52.240 --> 06:54.100
Why are you praying so hard today?

06:54.360 --> 06:55.430
What nonsense are you talking about?

06:55.430 --> 06:56.630
Come here, come here.

06:57.000 --> 06:59.460
Show some respect to
the God of Matchmaking.

07:02.360 --> 07:03.390
God of Matchmaking,

07:03.390 --> 07:05.120
please don't take offense.

07:05.190 --> 07:06.810
Please don't mishear.

07:07.240 --> 07:08.240
What I meant was

07:08.240 --> 07:10.360
that my husband at home
has flirtatious eyes

07:10.360 --> 07:11.360
and a short philtrum.

07:11.360 --> 07:14.000
I really wasn't talking about
my daughter's husband.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.640
Please don't get it wrong.

07:15.720 --> 07:16.720
Please, God of Matchmaking,

07:16.720 --> 07:17.800
please.

07:18.570 --> 07:20.400
I'll kowtow to you three times.

07:22.600 --> 07:25.200
God of Matchmaking, please bless
my daughter.

07:25.800 --> 07:28.460
Please bless my daughter
with a happy marriage.

07:28.950 --> 07:31.560
Please bless and protect my Yiting
for her entire life.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.690
Madam!

07:32.800 --> 07:33.310
Please.

07:33.310 --> 07:35.040
I've bought the Lovers' Knots.

07:35.480 --> 07:36.360
Great.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.120
Hurry up,

07:37.120 --> 07:38.650
tie them up in the branches.

07:41.190 --> 07:42.510
Hang it higher.

07:42.800 --> 07:44.540
The higher, the luckier.

07:46.760 --> 07:48.120
Why are you so clumsy?

07:48.120 --> 07:48.720
Come on, come on.

07:48.720 --> 07:49.510
Give it to me.

07:49.510 --> 07:50.510
I'll do it myself.

07:52.120 --> 07:52.950
Seriously.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.720
Hang it here.

07:56.720 --> 07:57.659
Here.

08:04.600 --> 08:06.630
This doesn't mean that I believe in
this sort of thing.

08:06.630 --> 08:08.980
But since I'm getting married,

08:09.120 --> 08:11.050
everything must be done properly,

08:11.120 --> 08:12.750
and I have to experience everything.

08:12.750 --> 08:13.600
Good girl.

08:16.190 --> 08:17.120
And these,

08:17.120 --> 08:17.720
tell me,

08:17.720 --> 08:19.180
where should we hang them?

08:27.040 --> 08:29.430
Fortunately, there aren't too many people
praying today.

08:29.430 --> 08:31.560
Everything worked out just as I hoped.

08:32.720 --> 08:33.549
In the future,

08:33.669 --> 08:35.130
I hope that God blesses you

08:35.840 --> 08:37.530
and lets you live happily.

08:37.630 --> 08:38.600
Mr. Feng, wake up.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.460
Time to go home.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.550
Mr. Feng?

08:46.270 --> 08:47.230
Mr. Feng?

08:47.480 --> 08:48.500
Mr. Feng!

08:50.630 --> 08:51.440
Mom,

08:51.510 --> 08:52.640
something's wrong!

08:54.440 --> 08:55.240
What's wrong?

09:03.550 --> 09:04.550
What do you want?

09:10.110 --> 09:11.440
I know it's very hard for you

09:11.440 --> 09:13.210
to make this decision.

09:13.480 --> 09:15.810
But if you continue to resist stubbornly,

09:16.230 --> 09:18.830
I can only take action against
the Song family.

09:19.810 --> 09:21.310
For example, your sister.

09:23.670 --> 09:24.820
What do you want?

09:26.120 --> 09:26.910
Your Grace!

09:29.720 --> 09:30.790
Is this from Rong Hua?

09:30.790 --> 09:31.440
Yes.

09:33.120 --> 09:34.600
What did you do to Yiting?

09:34.720 --> 09:36.750
Why don't you open it and see?

09:45.460 --> 09:47.540
Now, it's just one of her fingers,

09:47.570 --> 09:49.040
but whether Song Yiting lives or dies

09:49.040 --> 09:50.200
in the future

09:50.550 --> 09:51.670
is up to you.

09:57.360 --> 09:59.470
If you dare to lay a finger on them again,

09:59.470 --> 10:01.240
I'll kill you first.

10:01.500 --> 10:03.230
The north wind is strong today.

10:03.240 --> 10:05.020
The "Choice Between Two" scene
on the city tower

10:05.020 --> 10:06.620
must be quite the spectacle.

10:14.000 --> 10:14.630
Mother,

10:15.320 --> 10:16.910
you've been taking care of
His Majesty all morning.

10:16.910 --> 10:18.200
Let me handle things here.

10:18.200 --> 10:19.320
Go back and rest.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.520
The royal physician said

10:27.360 --> 10:28.470
that your father

10:28.910 --> 10:31.150
likely won't make it through this time.

10:32.630 --> 10:33.720
I just want to

10:34.320 --> 10:36.150
look at him properly once more.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.510
That way,

10:39.120 --> 10:41.080
if something really happens...

10:42.870 --> 10:44.080
when I think of him

10:45.270 --> 10:46.600
in the future,

10:46.600 --> 10:48.620
it won't only be those years

10:48.750 --> 10:51.190
when we glared at each other
with cold resentment

10:51.190 --> 10:53.120
and endless disputes.

11:02.490 --> 11:03.680
Your Majesty.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.240
Your Majesty!

11:06.750 --> 11:08.030
I'll go find Physician Qin.

11:08.030 --> 11:08.790
Okay.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.440
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.790
I've already sent people to find
the antidote.

11:15.790 --> 11:17.000
You will be fine.

11:22.780 --> 11:23.770
I suspect

11:24.000 --> 11:25.910
that all of this was orchestrated
by Chu Guihong.

11:25.910 --> 11:27.120
I will keep my guard up

11:27.140 --> 11:28.400
and find out the truth.

11:30.120 --> 11:31.630
I also beg Your Majesty

11:31.630 --> 11:34.890
to send the Xuanjia Army back
to the capital to deal with it.

12:01.890 --> 12:02.850
Heng.

12:05.930 --> 12:07.330
Get up first.

12:12.000 --> 12:13.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

12:20.390 --> 12:21.450
Rui

12:21.960 --> 12:24.240
has always sat by my side.

12:28.550 --> 12:29.410
Come on.

12:33.750 --> 12:34.550
Sit by my side.

12:37.200 --> 12:38.000
Yes.

12:47.750 --> 12:49.280
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

12:49.390 --> 12:50.240
I've arranged everything

12:50.240 --> 12:51.550
to protect Rui.

12:52.270 --> 12:53.320
I also promise you

12:53.870 --> 12:56.030
that I'll protect him with all I have.

12:56.200 --> 12:58.130
I won't let anything happen to him.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.750
Heng.

13:06.840 --> 13:08.110
Yes, Your Majesty?

13:12.360 --> 13:14.950
Rui never addresses me

13:15.440 --> 13:16.500
as "Your Majesty."

13:22.470 --> 13:23.630
Don't let me hear you

13:23.630 --> 13:25.230
call me "Father" ever again!

13:29.910 --> 13:31.840
It was my fault.

13:50.550 --> 13:51.870
Can you...

13:58.200 --> 13:59.320
Can you...

14:11.930 --> 14:12.850
Father.

14:28.960 --> 14:34.780
[Huanning Hall]

14:42.760 --> 14:46.790
[19 years ago]

14:46.910 --> 14:52.100
[Huanning Hall]

14:53.550 --> 14:54.880
What are you doing here?

14:56.280 --> 14:57.080
Fa...

14:57.870 --> 14:58.670
Father.

14:59.570 --> 15:04.440
[Huanning Hall]

14:59.910 --> 15:00.750
Your Majesty,

15:00.750 --> 15:02.270
today is your birthday.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.200
This snow tiger

15:04.390 --> 15:07.750
must be a birthday gift from
the Seventh Prince.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.670
Worthless and ignorant,

15:15.670 --> 15:16.960
only knowing how to mess around.

15:16.960 --> 15:17.910
Go back now.

15:18.960 --> 15:19.750
Yes.

15:24.480 --> 15:25.270
Forget it.

15:25.270 --> 15:26.750
Since it's a gift from him,

15:26.750 --> 15:27.750
take it inside.

15:51.750 --> 15:52.570
Your Highness,

15:52.570 --> 15:53.710
are you alright?

15:54.750 --> 15:56.120
Didn't I tell you to protect Nan Rui?

15:56.120 --> 15:57.310
Why are you here?

15:58.550 --> 15:59.950
It's the Crown Princess.

16:00.120 --> 16:01.600
She went to Lord Qianyu's manor.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.840
I don't know what she said to Lord Qianyu,

16:02.840 --> 16:04.390
and she didn't let the Xuanjia Army
follow her.

16:04.390 --> 16:05.720
After that, she left

16:05.840 --> 16:07.870
the manor alone with Lord Qianyu

16:08.000 --> 16:10.260
and had the Xuanjia Army bring this back.

16:12.150 --> 16:12.720
Nan Heng,

16:12.880 --> 16:14.140
you lied to me again.

16:14.510 --> 16:15.440
In the next life,

16:15.490 --> 16:16.860
I will punish you

16:16.910 --> 16:17.960
to kneel on many,

16:18.070 --> 16:19.880
many, many washboards.

16:20.600 --> 16:22.240
Go and gather 200 Xuanjia Army soldiers

16:22.240 --> 16:23.120
to follow me to the city tower.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.250
Yes, Your Highness.

16:29.270 --> 16:30.000
Well,

16:30.050 --> 16:31.410
don't blame me.

16:31.550 --> 16:33.120
If I weren't in such a hurry to get back,

16:33.120 --> 16:35.180
I wouldn't have treated you this way.

16:35.630 --> 16:37.360
Remember what you promised me.

16:37.630 --> 16:40.320
If Yiting and the Song family are
in the slightest danger,

16:40.320 --> 16:41.960
even if I go back,

16:42.010 --> 16:43.250
I won't let you off.

16:52.340 --> 16:59.000
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 37, Scene 19]

17:00.870 --> 17:01.840
Qianyu rebels!

17:01.860 --> 17:03.310
Let go of me!

17:03.600 --> 17:04.400
Yiting!

17:04.400 --> 17:05.109
Yimeng.

17:05.109 --> 17:06.050
Yiting!

17:06.550 --> 17:07.589
Yiting.

17:07.720 --> 17:08.680
Are you alright?

17:10.030 --> 17:11.540
Let her go now!

17:11.560 --> 17:14.270
We can't let her go
until this iconic scene is completed.

17:14.270 --> 17:15.200
Yimeng,

17:15.349 --> 17:17.079
Mother is still in their hands.

17:19.790 --> 17:21.240
This has nothing to do with Madam.

17:21.240 --> 17:23.089
Release her right here and right now,

17:23.089 --> 17:24.089
otherwise

17:24.589 --> 17:26.119
I won't cooperate with you.

17:26.800 --> 17:27.839
Relax.

17:27.920 --> 17:29.590
She's perfectly fine in the carriage.

17:29.590 --> 17:30.680
She's just still unconscious

17:30.680 --> 17:31.880
due to some medicine.

17:32.470 --> 17:34.000
You know exactly what I want.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.400
What's in it for me to kill people
at random?

17:42.380 --> 17:43.780
Please cooperate with me

17:43.800 --> 17:45.600
and play out these messy scenes.

17:45.620 --> 17:46.380
I guarantee

17:46.410 --> 17:49.310
I'll safely send them back
in a grand eight-carrier sedan.

17:49.310 --> 17:50.030
Yimeng,

17:50.110 --> 17:50.790
whatever he promises,

17:50.790 --> 17:52.250
don't believe a word of it.

17:52.310 --> 17:54.480
Rather than be held hostage
by someone else,

17:54.480 --> 17:56.270
I'd rather take control of my own fate

17:56.270 --> 17:58.050
and fight him to the bitter end!

18:03.510 --> 18:04.310
Yiting.

18:05.270 --> 18:06.070
I'm sorry.

18:06.870 --> 18:08.200
I dragged you into this.

18:09.880 --> 18:10.750
Don't worry.

18:11.620 --> 18:13.190
I will save you.

18:13.610 --> 18:15.060
After a few hours,

18:15.880 --> 18:16.880
everything

18:17.110 --> 18:18.160
will be over.

18:18.550 --> 18:19.560
Song Yimeng,

18:19.720 --> 18:20.640
what are you going to do?

18:20.640 --> 18:21.810
Tell me.

18:22.830 --> 18:23.640
Song Yimeng!

18:23.640 --> 18:24.200
Song Yimeng!

18:24.200 --> 18:25.450
Don't worry, Yiting!

18:25.640 --> 18:27.600
I won't let anything happen to you!

18:34.240 --> 18:35.600
After the arrows are shot,

18:35.600 --> 18:38.460
I promise I'll push forward the plot
of human swine.

18:39.550 --> 18:40.350
Here.

18:40.770 --> 18:42.080
Tie yourself up.

18:58.880 --> 18:59.740
Your Highness,

18:59.750 --> 19:00.680
the troops are ready.

19:00.680 --> 19:02.480
Why isn't Shangguan He here yet?

19:03.240 --> 19:05.830
This matter concerns the safety
of Song Yiting and Song Yimeng.

19:05.830 --> 19:07.200
Shangguan He will come.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.440
But...

19:08.590 --> 19:09.510
does it have to be him?

19:09.510 --> 19:10.400
Can't I do it?

19:11.000 --> 19:12.200
You have another job.

19:13.270 --> 19:14.070
Chief!

19:16.890 --> 19:17.970
What's wrong?

19:19.030 --> 19:20.110
By the time I arrived,

19:20.110 --> 19:21.790
Song Yiting had already been taken
by the Qianyu Army.

19:21.790 --> 19:23.750
We were even ambushed along the way.

19:23.750 --> 19:25.240
Yunlong and Shanhu stayed behind
to cover my retreat

19:25.240 --> 19:26.770
so that I could make it back.

19:27.000 --> 19:27.750
Chief,

19:28.270 --> 19:30.830
they've mobilized a large number
of the Qianyu Army.

19:30.830 --> 19:31.690
Your Highness,

19:31.840 --> 19:34.000
there are only 300 Xuanjia Army soldiers
in the capital in total,

19:34.000 --> 19:35.530
and some were sent to the palace.

19:35.530 --> 19:36.930
We may not stand a chance.

19:37.830 --> 19:39.350
The border troops are on their way back,

19:39.350 --> 19:40.720
but they'll need at least three days.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.350
Until then,

19:41.350 --> 19:42.280
we must hold out.

19:43.000 --> 19:43.800
Let's do this.

19:44.310 --> 19:45.310
Send someone to Waning River Crescent

19:45.310 --> 19:46.750
to ask the Nightwalker to help
Yunlong and Shanhu.

19:46.750 --> 19:48.590
Tell them to make sure they stall
the Qianyu Army

19:48.590 --> 19:49.940
for at least one hour.

19:49.970 --> 19:51.100
Yes, Your Highness.

19:57.200 --> 19:58.510
You are already like this.

19:58.510 --> 19:59.720
Why don't you go back first?

19:59.720 --> 20:01.640
Leave the "Choice Between Two" to me.

20:01.640 --> 20:02.480
Choose? Like hell.

20:02.480 --> 20:03.030
You save your woman,

20:03.030 --> 20:04.090
and I'll save mine.

20:04.480 --> 20:05.270
Besides,

20:05.270 --> 20:06.820
Chu Li's real target is me.

20:07.110 --> 20:08.070
I have to go.

20:11.640 --> 20:12.440
Fine.

20:12.920 --> 20:13.880
Then tell me

20:13.880 --> 20:14.920
how I can help.

20:18.770 --> 20:28.070
[Yanxing Gate]

20:39.510 --> 20:40.710
It's really snowing.

20:44.550 --> 20:46.070
I told you.

20:47.590 --> 20:49.440
Fate can't be changed.

20:50.310 --> 20:51.550
Any resistance

20:51.550 --> 20:53.080
is just asking for trouble.

20:53.790 --> 20:54.840
In the end,

20:55.480 --> 20:57.030
you'll all come back here

20:57.350 --> 20:58.830
and meet the same fate.

21:00.200 --> 21:02.800
Even if it's the same city tower
and heavy snow,

21:03.160 --> 21:04.560
and even if I'll

21:05.410 --> 21:07.470
go along with the storyline with you,

21:08.350 --> 21:10.280
it doesn't mean that everyone else

21:10.310 --> 21:12.240
will live the way you want them to.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.500
Because everyone here

21:16.000 --> 21:17.600
is no longer that group of...

21:19.510 --> 21:22.240
fictional characters to be manipulated
at will.

21:31.830 --> 21:32.640
General,

21:33.160 --> 21:33.960
they're here.

21:35.160 --> 21:36.680
Bring Song Yiting here.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.350
Yes.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.640
Bring her here!

21:45.330 --> 21:48.250
[Suzhang Gate]

21:48.350 --> 21:50.500
[Yanxing Gate]

21:51.310 --> 21:52.110
Chu Li!

21:53.640 --> 21:54.440
I'm here.

21:54.770 --> 21:55.570
Release her!

22:03.310 --> 22:04.110
Chu Li!

22:05.200 --> 22:06.000
Nan Heng,

22:06.590 --> 22:07.480
listen up.

22:08.070 --> 22:10.440
The antidote for the Emperor
is in my hands.

22:10.440 --> 22:13.750
The evidence proving that Nan Rui
poisoned him is also with me!

22:13.750 --> 22:14.830
If you don't want to become
an eternal sinner

22:14.830 --> 22:17.220
who has killed your father and brother,

22:17.350 --> 22:19.080
shoot the arrows immediately!

22:19.200 --> 22:20.920
You know the ending I want.

22:22.070 --> 22:23.470
Today, at the city tower,

22:24.000 --> 22:26.000
until this "Choice Between Two" scene
is complete,

22:26.000 --> 22:27.040
everything

22:27.400 --> 22:28.880
will never end.

22:30.830 --> 22:31.640
Nan Heng!

22:34.280 --> 22:35.490
In this world,

22:36.830 --> 22:37.640
I've never done anything

22:37.640 --> 22:38.960
to benefit everyone.

22:40.310 --> 22:41.270
But today...

22:42.850 --> 22:44.170
if I can die

22:45.030 --> 22:47.430
for the safety of you
and the Song family...

22:48.920 --> 22:49.720
I'll do it!

22:51.160 --> 22:51.960
Song Yimeng!

22:53.160 --> 22:54.760
You said fate can be changed!

22:55.720 --> 22:57.050
I don't believe in fate,

22:57.240 --> 22:58.220
and neither do you!

22:58.220 --> 22:59.240
Do you hear me?

23:02.920 --> 23:04.310
Saying cheesy lines

23:04.310 --> 23:06.070
at a time like this?

23:19.160 --> 23:20.050
[Yanxing Gate]

23:27.480 --> 23:28.270
Song Yimeng!

23:28.270 --> 23:29.070
Come down!

23:29.750 --> 23:30.510
Hurry!

23:30.510 --> 23:31.240
Go!

23:31.960 --> 23:32.850
Yiting!

23:46.920 --> 23:47.590
Nan Heng.

24:23.960 --> 24:24.960
What do you think?

24:25.310 --> 24:26.440
Other girls have,

24:26.510 --> 24:28.370
and our Yiting deserves the same.

24:30.030 --> 24:30.680
Stay back!

24:32.600 --> 24:33.730
I'll count to three.

24:34.240 --> 24:35.440
Your master's life

24:35.830 --> 24:37.960
in exchange for letting our Yiting go.

24:38.000 --> 24:39.440
If you don't want to,

24:40.160 --> 24:42.480
then let's see whose sword strikes first.

24:42.480 --> 24:43.240
Rong Hua,

24:43.240 --> 24:44.230
save me!

24:54.790 --> 24:56.140
No need to count.

24:56.720 --> 24:57.780
What have you done?

24:58.270 --> 24:59.830
He was Lord Qianyu.

25:00.030 --> 25:01.070
You actually killed him?

25:01.070 --> 25:03.070
My loyalty lies not with Lord Qianyu

25:03.310 --> 25:05.310
but solely with the Junior General.

25:05.920 --> 25:08.440
Soldiers of the Qianyu Army,
heed my command!

25:08.440 --> 25:09.920
Shangguan He, the subordinate
of Nan Heng...

25:09.920 --> 25:10.720
Oh no.

25:10.720 --> 25:11.640
Brutally murdered the general!

25:11.640 --> 25:12.510
Their target is you.

25:12.510 --> 25:13.200
Qianyu Army,

25:13.200 --> 25:14.680
by the order of the Junior General,

25:14.680 --> 25:16.640
eliminate Nan Heng and his followers!

25:16.640 --> 25:18.300
Xuanjia Army, heed my orders!

25:18.450 --> 25:19.690
Today, follow me

25:20.230 --> 25:21.720
and break through at all costs!

25:21.720 --> 25:22.920
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

25:24.820 --> 25:26.480
[Imperial Study]

25:31.270 --> 25:32.110
General Chu,

25:32.240 --> 25:35.170
how dare you break into
His Majesty's bedchamber...

25:38.440 --> 25:39.450
Chu Guihong,

25:39.480 --> 25:40.760
what do you want?

25:44.970 --> 25:47.200
Of course, I'm here to help His Majesty
defend the throne.

25:47.200 --> 25:49.090
The Crown Prince colluded with Liu Mingxi

25:49.090 --> 25:51.290
and killed the Emperor and his brother.

25:51.320 --> 25:53.170
I had no choice but to kill him

25:53.270 --> 25:54.870
under these circumstances.

25:55.070 --> 25:57.200
Murdered the Emperor and his brother?

25:57.310 --> 25:58.840
What are you talking about?

26:00.940 --> 26:02.160
Before I came,

26:02.590 --> 26:03.880
I had someone finish

26:03.880 --> 26:05.270
today's Emperor's Daily Diary.

26:05.270 --> 26:06.660
"His Majesty, aged and weary,

26:06.660 --> 26:08.720
reminiscing about the late Empress,

26:09.030 --> 26:10.440
chose to appoint a new heir

26:10.440 --> 26:12.880
and passed the throne to
the Eighteenth Prince, Nan Rui.

26:12.880 --> 26:15.310
But the Crown Prince, Nan Heng,
grew resentful

26:15.310 --> 26:16.770
and poisoned His Majesty,

26:17.240 --> 26:19.040
framing Nan Rui as the culprit."

26:21.880 --> 26:23.410
Your Ladyship, do you think

26:23.720 --> 26:24.960
this will make for

26:25.030 --> 26:27.110
a fine chapter

26:27.400 --> 26:28.800
in future history books?

26:29.310 --> 26:30.640
You want to rebel.

26:31.240 --> 26:33.570
Heng will never let you get away
with this!

26:34.220 --> 26:35.830
The Xuanjia Army is still at the border,

26:35.830 --> 26:38.430
while the capital is guarded
by my Qianyu Army.

26:40.770 --> 26:42.010
Your beloved son

26:42.440 --> 26:44.240
is about to die on the city tower.

26:44.310 --> 26:45.750
How will he stop me?

26:46.390 --> 26:48.350
300 Xuanjia Army soldiers in the capital

26:48.350 --> 26:50.520
against 5,000 Qianyu Army soldiers.

26:50.640 --> 26:52.990
Even if Nan Heng had nine lives,

26:53.830 --> 26:55.640
he wouldn't survive this.

27:01.640 --> 27:02.400
Xuanjia Army!

27:02.400 --> 27:03.240
Go up and save them!

27:03.240 --> 27:04.110
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

27:04.110 --> 27:04.880
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

27:04.880 --> 27:05.590
Fugui!

27:05.680 --> 27:06.810
Take her away first!

27:08.070 --> 27:08.720
No!

27:08.720 --> 27:09.640
Listen to me!

27:12.310 --> 27:13.270
Fugui, hurry!

27:13.290 --> 27:14.360
I can't leave.

27:14.480 --> 27:15.510
If we live, we live together.

27:15.510 --> 27:16.970
If we die, we die together!

27:20.750 --> 27:21.480
Protect her.

27:21.480 --> 27:21.960
Yes.

27:21.960 --> 27:22.590
Nan Heng.

27:51.090 --> 27:52.350
Stop the Xuanjia Army climbing up.

27:52.350 --> 27:54.010
Don't let them rescue anyone!

28:11.950 --> 28:13.310
Shangguan He!

28:17.200 --> 28:18.000
Shangguan He.

28:18.220 --> 28:19.020
Shangguan He.

28:22.130 --> 28:23.000
Shangguan He,

28:23.000 --> 28:24.130
how are you?

28:28.750 --> 28:30.810
I wanted to be the hero and save you...

28:31.810 --> 28:33.160
but I didn't expect to let you

28:33.160 --> 28:34.620
see me at my most pathetic.

28:36.880 --> 28:38.020
I made a mistake.

28:38.160 --> 28:39.070
At a time like this,

28:39.070 --> 28:40.780
you still have the mood to joke?

28:40.780 --> 28:41.440
Let's go.

28:41.440 --> 28:42.270
Let's go home.

28:42.550 --> 28:43.350
Let's go!

28:50.590 --> 28:52.290
Song Yiting, listen carefully.

28:52.290 --> 28:53.570
In the future, whoever you choose,

28:53.570 --> 28:55.020
he can't be worse than me.

28:56.160 --> 28:56.960
Fugui!

29:04.050 --> 29:04.920
Yiting!

29:05.040 --> 29:05.990
Song Yiting,

29:06.160 --> 29:07.660
there are things

29:07.790 --> 29:09.630
that should be done by men.

29:10.090 --> 29:11.580
Like being the first to ask

29:12.030 --> 29:13.630
and the first to fall in love.

29:13.670 --> 29:14.990
The more you do,

29:15.550 --> 29:16.400
the less there is left

29:16.400 --> 29:17.200
for me to do.

29:18.510 --> 29:19.720
But luckily,

29:19.920 --> 29:22.030
there's still one last thing I can do,

29:22.550 --> 29:23.980
and that's to use my life

29:24.350 --> 29:25.850
to protect you well.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.100
Shangguan He.

29:33.330 --> 29:34.580
Shangguan He!

29:38.680 --> 29:40.310
Shangguan He!

29:45.590 --> 29:46.750
Shangguan He!

29:46.750 --> 29:47.440
Yiting.

29:52.270 --> 29:53.550
Shangguan He!

29:53.550 --> 29:54.160
Fugui!

29:54.180 --> 29:54.850
Take her away!

29:54.850 --> 29:55.240
Yes.

29:55.240 --> 29:56.000
Let go of me!

30:55.680 --> 30:56.620
Nan Heng!

30:57.090 --> 30:58.010
Nan Heng!

30:59.480 --> 31:00.260
Nan Heng!

31:03.400 --> 31:04.200
See?

31:06.480 --> 31:08.480
When the female lead is in danger...

31:09.310 --> 31:11.040
the male lead comes to save her.

31:17.550 --> 31:18.240
Nan Heng.

31:19.000 --> 31:19.910
Nan Heng.

31:20.790 --> 31:21.590
Nan Heng.

31:21.720 --> 31:22.830
You're right.

31:24.600 --> 31:25.800
You're the male lead.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.340
So you'll be fine,

31:28.400 --> 31:29.160
right?

31:32.590 --> 31:33.520
Nan Heng.

31:34.030 --> 31:34.720
You can't die.

31:34.720 --> 31:35.800
Do you hear me?

31:35.830 --> 31:36.790
Do you hear me?

31:36.790 --> 31:37.440
You can't die!

31:37.440 --> 31:38.870
Do you hear me?

31:39.550 --> 31:40.510
Answer me!

31:40.510 --> 31:41.770
Do you hear me?

31:42.680 --> 31:43.590
I hear you.

31:43.850 --> 31:44.970
I hear you.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.000
Don't worry.

31:49.500 --> 31:50.960
I'm your male lead.

31:52.550 --> 31:53.660
I won't die.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.370
Nan Heng.

32:10.560 --> 32:11.450
Nan Heng.

32:12.190 --> 32:14.390
Hang in there, okay?

32:14.460 --> 32:15.400
Listen to me,

32:15.400 --> 32:16.830
hang in there, okay?

32:17.010 --> 32:19.290
You can't die, Nan Heng.

32:19.360 --> 32:21.750
You're the only one I have in this world.

32:21.750 --> 32:23.040
Do you know that?

32:23.310 --> 32:24.590
I have no one else.

32:24.590 --> 32:26.580
You really are... all I have left.

32:26.610 --> 32:28.400
Please don't die.

32:28.400 --> 32:30.000
I beg you.

32:30.770 --> 32:31.610
Okay?

32:37.810 --> 32:38.610
I...

32:39.030 --> 32:39.750
I...

32:41.450 --> 32:42.650
Nan Heng...

33:02.130 --> 33:03.650
Nan Heng.

33:19.700 --> 33:20.780
Nan Heng!

33:20.960 --> 33:21.590
Only...

33:22.200 --> 33:23.130
only by dying...

33:25.150 --> 33:26.050
can I prove

33:26.970 --> 33:28.900
that I'm not a fictional character

33:29.270 --> 33:30.160
that...

33:31.720 --> 33:33.220
I've truly lived.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.570
Song...

33:42.820 --> 33:43.990
Song Yimeng...

33:47.690 --> 33:48.460
Thank...

33:51.540 --> 33:52.990
thank you.

34:12.800 --> 34:13.800
Nan Heng.

34:15.190 --> 34:16.110
Nan Heng!

34:16.820 --> 34:18.489
Nan Heng!

34:18.889 --> 34:20.350
Nan Heng!

34:20.440 --> 34:22.150
Don't die,

34:22.170 --> 34:23.280
Nan Heng.

34:23.300 --> 34:25.030
Nan Heng!

34:27.560 --> 34:29.420
Nan Heng...

34:34.429 --> 34:36.560
Nan Heng...

34:37.250 --> 34:42.850
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

34:42.250 --> 34:44.909
You've been awake this whole time,
haven't you?

34:44.960 --> 34:46.699
I was so afraid something might
happen to you!

34:46.460 --> 34:52.070
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

34:46.730 --> 34:47.590
But you!

34:47.590 --> 34:49.449
You didn't tell me you were awake!

34:50.850 --> 34:52.110
I'm sorry

34:52.480 --> 34:53.679
for making you worry.

34:55.139 --> 34:59.200
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

35:00.260 --> 35:03.010
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

35:04.120 --> 35:08.800
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

35:12.820 --> 35:15.950
♪ Let the wind flip through
the past chapters of my life ♪

35:13.550 --> 35:14.640
Nan Heng!

35:14.660 --> 35:15.800
Please wake up!

35:15.800 --> 35:17.630
Please wake up now!

35:17.170 --> 35:20.270
♪ Let brush and ink
depict my adventures ♪

35:19.360 --> 35:20.530
You're awake.

35:21.520 --> 35:28.090
♪ Let's see in how many ways
fate can shape my life ♪

35:30.600 --> 35:34.040
♪ Let moonlight shine on
the lines about love and hate ♪

35:35.040 --> 35:38.600
♪ Let me bang my head
against a brick wall ♪

35:39.600 --> 35:45.820
♪ If this is my destiny,
I'll accept it ♪

35:41.740 --> 35:42.800
Song Yimeng.

35:44.580 --> 35:45.590
From now on,

35:45.960 --> 35:47.620
no matter what happens,

35:47.810 --> 35:49.430
we'll face it together.

35:50.110 --> 35:51.510
Whatever you worry about,

35:51.510 --> 35:52.590
whatever you fear,

35:53.010 --> 35:54.980
I'll solve it all for you one by one.

35:57.110 --> 35:58.020
Nan Heng,

35:58.630 --> 35:59.800
from now on,

36:00.280 --> 36:03.210
you're not allowed to hide anything
from me anymore.

36:03.670 --> 36:04.710
If I catch you

36:04.710 --> 36:06.070
lying to me again,

36:06.880 --> 36:07.940
you'll be kneeling

36:08.090 --> 36:10.150
on a washboard for the rest of your life.

36:10.150 --> 36:10.960
Okay.

36:12.070 --> 36:14.330
I'll listen to you in everything you say.

36:19.940 --> 36:23.740
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

36:24.500 --> 36:27.540
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

36:28.960 --> 36:35.420
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

36:37.880 --> 36:41.280
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

36:42.330 --> 36:46.100
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

36:43.190 --> 36:44.160
Oh, you.

36:44.510 --> 36:45.440
Remember,

36:45.440 --> 36:47.300
you're just a fictional character.

36:46.990 --> 36:53.510
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

36:47.440 --> 36:49.590
And I have the protagonist aura,

36:49.710 --> 36:51.040
so I should protect you.

36:51.760 --> 36:52.960
I'm the Crown Prince.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.160
In the future,

36:54.230 --> 36:55.760
who knows what will happen?

36:56.000 --> 36:56.800
Quiet.

37:09.660 --> 37:12.850
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

37:13.850 --> 37:16.960
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

37:18.310 --> 37:24.950
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

37:27.300 --> 37:30.670
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

37:31.610 --> 37:36.010
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

37:38.490 --> 37:46.600
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

38:04.510 --> 38:05.420
Song Yimeng!

38:06.760 --> 38:08.110
Nan Heng is dead!

38:09.150 --> 38:10.950
If you choose the righteous path

38:11.320 --> 38:14.280
and testify against him for killing
the Emperor and his brother,

38:14.280 --> 38:16.000
I will spare your life!

38:39.230 --> 38:41.230
Mountains weren't born with peaks,

38:41.510 --> 38:43.150
and roads weren't born flat.

38:44.250 --> 38:46.210
Whether it's humiliation or ups and downs,

38:46.210 --> 38:47.820
joy or sorrow,

38:48.400 --> 38:49.930
I have my own hands and feet.

38:50.510 --> 38:51.710
I can trample through thorns

38:51.710 --> 38:54.110
or raise my sword to challenge
the heavens.

38:54.400 --> 38:55.400
Why should the outcome

38:55.400 --> 38:57.460
of my life be in someone else's hands?

38:58.550 --> 38:59.550
If there is really some rule‑maker

38:59.550 --> 39:01.550
pulling strings behind the scenes,

39:02.230 --> 39:03.400
then the one holding the pen

39:03.400 --> 39:04.670
should be me.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.070
Nan Heng,

39:07.710 --> 39:08.410
thank you.

39:09.330 --> 39:10.350
In the past,

39:11.150 --> 39:12.710
I've run away many times.

39:13.300 --> 39:14.270
But today,

39:14.870 --> 39:16.410
I want to hold everything

39:16.960 --> 39:19.090
in my own hands, just like you.

39:19.630 --> 39:21.090
Even if it costs me my life.

39:58.940 --> 40:00.670
Nan Heng...
